### Approval queue scenario: list what waits, approve, correct and approve, reject, undo, and the mode settings.
### There is no request that adds a suggestion: the inbox, voice and briefing modules make them inside the app
### (EylemServisi.OnerAsync). To get something to approve while trying this by hand, call OnerAsync from a test or a scratch endpoint.
### Run the requests top to bottom (VS Code REST Client or Rider HTTP Client).
### Fill the seed account values from user-secrets: Seed:SahipEmail / Seed:SahipPassword
### (and Seed:AsistanEmail / Seed:AsistanPassword for the 403 example). Do not commit real values.

@host = http://localhost:5051
@sahipEmail = <Seed:SahipEmail>
@sahipSifre = <Seed:SahipPassword>
@asistanEmail = <Seed:AsistanEmail>
@asistanSifre = <Seed:AsistanPassword>

# Take an id from request 3 (a pending action) and paste it here.
@eylemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Log in as Sahip
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{sahipEmail}}", "password": "{{sahipSifre}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. The mode of every action kind (sor is the default; Sahip only)
GET {{host}}/api/yonetim/eylem-izinleri
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Pending actions, newest first. ?durum=uygulandi|reddedildi|geriAlindi|hatali for the others
GET {{host}}/api/eylemler
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. One action: payload, summary, source, reason, confidence
GET {{host}}/api/eylemler/{{eylemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Approve as suggested -> 200 (applied; "geriAlmaBilgisi" says what undo will touch). Again -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/eylemler/{{eylemId}}/uygula
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Approve with a corrected payload (checked again) -> 200, or 400 under "yuk" if it is wrong
POST {{host}}/api/eylemler/{{eylemId}}/uygula
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "yuk": { "baslik": "Ali'yi ara", "gun": "2026-12-01", "saat": "10:30:00" } }

### 7. Reject -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/eylemler/{{eylemId}}/reddet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "birDahaOnerme": false }

### 8. Reject and never suggest this kind again -> the kind becomes yasak for good
POST {{host}}/api/eylemler/{{eylemId}}/reddet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "birDahaOnerme": true }

### 9. Undo an applied action -> 200 (a reminder is archived, not deleted). An action that was not applied -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/eylemler/{{eylemId}}/geri-al
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Set a mode: sor (ask first), kendinYap (apply at once; outside-source suggestions still wait) or yasak (never suggest)
PUT {{host}}/api/yonetim/eylem-izinleri/hatirlatici-kur
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kip": "kendinYap" }

### 11. Back to asking first
PUT {{host}}/api/yonetim/eylem-izinleri/hatirlatici-kur
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kip": "sor" }

### 12. Log in as Asistan
# @name asistanLogin
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{asistanEmail}}", "password": "{{asistanSifre}}" }

###
@asistanToken = {{asistanLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 13. Without the eylem.oku permission -> 403 (grant it with PUT /api/yonetim/izinler/eylem.oku)
GET {{host}}/api/eylemler
Authorization: Bearer {{asistanToken}}

### 14. The modes are the Sahip's alone, whatever the Asistan holds -> 403
PUT {{host}}/api/yonetim/eylem-izinleri/hatirlatici-kur
Authorization: Bearer {{asistanToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kip": "kendinYap" }
